        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alan Dean Foster; Samuel R. Delany\n- Roles: writer; author; professor; literary critic\n- Genres: fantasy; science fiction\n- Topics: novelizations; memoir; criticism; essays on sexuality and society\n\nFacts:\n- Samuel R. Delany was born on April 1, 1942, and is an American author, professor, and literary critic.\n- Alan Dean Foster was born on November 18, 1946, and is an American writer of fantasy and science fiction.\n- Samuel R. Delany's work includes fiction, especially science fiction, as well as memoir, criticism, and essays on sexuality and society.\n- Alan Dean Foster is a prolific creator of and contributor to book series and the author of more than 20 standalone novels.\n- Alan Dean Foster is especially prolific in writing novelizations of film scripts.",
